{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>איש חסד גומל נפשו</b> — and sustains it with his kindness and maintains it until the year of old age." "<b>שארו</b> — his flesh. The cruel one acts with willful wrath until he destroys another. He said: his flesh, with the cruel one, for his desire is to sustain the body with the pleasures of the world, while the pious one sustains the soul, with his flesh and with his kindness."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:10.208194836Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}